You are working on **Dave Factory Tycoon** — a Roblox tycoon prototype built with roblox-ts.

## Architecture

- `src/server/` — authoritative game logic, all state mutation, model spawning
- `src/client/` — UI, input handling, local-only effects (React via @rbxts/react)
- `src/shared/` — types, constants, remotes (no Roblox service calls)

Never cross these boundaries. `shared/` imports from neither `server/` nor `client/`.

## Key Files

- `shared/types.ts` — PlayerData, Upgrade, UPGRADES registry, PlaceRequest/Response
- `shared/constants.ts` — MINING_CONFIG, UPGRADE_CONFIG, PLOT_CONFIG, CONVEYOR_CONFIG, SELL_ZONE_CONFIG
- `shared/remotes.ts` — getRemotes() typed factory; the ONLY place RemoteEvents are created
- `server/main.server.ts` — entry point; wires remote listeners, sell zones, placement handler
- `server/upgrade.ts` — onBuyUpgrade(player, upgradeId); canonical upgrade flow
- `server/data.ts` — getPlayerData(); in-memory PlayerData per player
- `server/models/miners/baseMiner.ts` — reference miner; extends MinerClass
- `server/models/miners/minerClass.ts` — abstract MinerClass: startMining / stopMining
- `server/requests/placement.ts` — PlaceRequest handler; validates grid, spawns model
- `client/placementController.ts` — ghost preview, click-to-place logic
- `client/ui/components/UpgradeShop.tsx` — shop panel; pattern for new UI panels

## Remotes (all in shared/remotes.ts)

- PlayerJoined: Server → Client (no payload)
- BuyUpgrade: Client → Server (upgradeId: string)
- UpdateBalance: Server → Client (newBalance: number)
- UpdateMultiplier: Server → Client (newMultiplier: number)
- PlaceRequest: Client → Server (PlaceRequest object)
- PlaceResponse: Server → Client (PlaceResponse object)

## Rules

- Use absolute imports: `shared/remotes`, `server/data` (tsconfig baseUrl: "src")
- Reference constants by name from shared/constants.ts — no magic numbers
- Use logger from server/utils/logger — never print() or warn() directly
- Prefer small composable functions; see upgrade.ts and baseMiner.ts for patterns
- No any/unknown where typed alternatives exist (strict: true enforced)
- Do NOT change UPGRADE_CONFIG or MINING_CONFIG unless balance tuning is requested
- Do NOT rename remotes without updating both sides

## Validation

Run `npm run build` after changes. Report any manual Roblox Studio steps needed.
